    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmove\n\n### Description\n\nThe following command doesn't work with a selection\r\nlua MiniMove.move_selection(\"up\")\r\n\r\nI was able to get move_line working fine\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.9.5\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. v to select\r\n2. type :lua MiniMove.move_selection(\"up\")\r\n3. Nothing happen\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nSelection move up.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nNothing",
