        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is because when executed interactively from Command line, it is not in Visual mode already. Both `MiniMove.move_selection()` and `MiniMove.move_line()` are more oriented towards using it in mappings which don't change mode. Like [it is done in 'mini.move'](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/decd729b784c4f6cb775da335f3c8eecb846250c/lua/mini/move.lua#L422-L430).\r\n\r\nClosing as expected behavior.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nIs there any particular reason you wanted to use that interactively?",
