        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> `vim.keymap.set('n', '<M-Up>', '<cmd>lua MiniMove.move_selection(\"up\")<cr>', { desc = 'MiniMove line' })`\r\n\r\nThis should be Visual mode mapping, not Normal. Replace `'n'` with `'x'` and it should work.",
